# Secrets — never commit these. H4: .dev.vars holds live Telegram/Facebook
# tokens (see README "Configure Local Secrets"); one `git add -A` without
# this entry would publish them to this public repo. If a secrets file is
# ever committed by mistake, rotate the tokens immediately (BotFather for
# Telegram, Meta Access Token Debugger / app dashboard for Facebook) and
# purge the file from git history.
.dev.vars
.env
.env*
*.vars
